# Top-level entries of ~/.claude that tagteam shares into profiles: the share
# allowlist of spec 12.2, the must-share entries first.
#
# Format, for this file and known-private: one entry per line; blank lines and
# lines starting with '#' are ignored. An entry is a bare file or directory name,
# with no trailing '/', so a directory is listed as "projects", not "projects/".
# Names compare exactly; each '*' in an entry matches any run of characters,
# possibly empty, against the whole name. No path separators.
